Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent pest control companies around {City}. {Business Name} has good reviews, but someone who finds mice in the garage tonight can't see a plan price or book a treatment without calling.

I built a sample first instead of asking for your time: quarterly plan prices, online booking for a first treatment, a termite inspection page and plain prep instructions for families, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

